  "verifiedControls": [
    "Dedicated canonical inference-proof taskID/output/official receipt,ordinal1 andworkers2 are registered with fixed600-second reservation. Original66d45a genesis/full ledger,active canonical lease,actual parentPID,launch/contract/snapshot and frozen entry checks remain enforced. Original cycle budget/settled-task checks prevent reusing this task.",
    "Parent requires two distinct current body-role/request APPROVE_PILOT_EXECUTION reports,exact request contract membership,reviewed copied source/spec bytes,closed tree and pinned Node/installed runtime/inputs. Proof mode selects inference-proof-worker.ts,soft180/hard240 and conservative2*whole-device-wall accounting;240*2+120=600. It does not invoke a two-worker pool or claim two actual concurrent workers.",
    "All156 actual snapshot files hash/realpath-match and the tree is closed apart from its declared manifest/aliases. All required reviewed sources,contract inputs,spec sources and two used weight files are present with correct hashes. All28 copied protected package files match the prior teacher003 snapshot; productAI/engine code is unchanged.",
    "The16unique ordered seeds are exactly the prior speed-spec rows. Copied old speed report matches its original hash and both2/4 configurations have16 complete samples. Worker compares every new original trace/games/decisions against the old actual original baseline by ordinal/seed.",
    "385 uses317+68 and399 uses331+68. The optimizer preserves bias-first Number accumulation,stores finite prefix accumulators inFloat64,resumes suffix order and retains originaltanh/Float32 boundaries/later loops. Ordinary shape/local-buffer,finite input,prefix equality and effectful alias fallback checks are present. No cross-call score/weight cache exists.",
    "Installation requires an actual fresh MLP.prototype.forward and a WeakSet prevents repeat wrapping. Model cache keys include weightsSHA,inputDim andexecution mode,so original/verify/fast own distinct fresh instances. Default remainsoriginal and an unknown mode rejects before a match. This addresses the prior independent-reference capture concern.",
    "Verified mode calls independent original and the candidate on each supported neural batch,compares everyFloat32 output usingUint32 bits before returning scores toNeuralDecider,then records comparison counters. Worker rejects unless all verified-match batches are compared. A poisoned score is caught before selection.",
    "Policy candidate generation/order,encoder/pass/compat options,first-strict-max/epsilon logic,collectFeat,per-seat action RNG andindexed future-deal namespace remain unchanged. Full-match comparator requires completeness and compareswinner/games/decisions/rootG/finalW/rootTeamTarget/full trace/policyIDs/deals/ownPlanSummary.",
    "Worker runs exactlythree fixed modes for each of16seeds,alternates original/verify/fast versusfast/verify/original,requires every result complete,and writes success report only after all cross-mode and prior-baseline checks. Warm first match per mode is separated;15remaining timings produce the fixed median/p90. A deadline/incomplete/error yields no passing proof.",
    "Current micro-preflight002 source hashes match the frozen revision. It remains a decision-batch microbenchmark,not a whole-match or scientific adoption result. The requested48-match execution is the next proof,not evidence already obtained."
  ],
